      "value": "This issue may be related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/vrc-constraints-processing-order-of-the-converted-vrcconstraints-may-differ-from , but since I don't know the implementation details and cannot determine the cause, I'm submitting it as a separate ticket tentatively.\n\nIf the root cause is the same, please merge them.",
